Charged DMG.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_05","effects":["N11160001"],"linkedConstellations":null,"advancedProps":[{"name":"Extra Lunar-Charged","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"50","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"5":{"skillId":11622,"type":2,"name":"Panoramic Permutation Protocol","description":"When using the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11165}Supreme Instruction: Cyclonic Exterminator{/LINK}</color>, all your party members will gain the Parameter Permutation effect: Increases Ineffa and your own active party member's Elemental Mastery by 6% of Ineffa's ATK for 20s.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_06","linkedConstellations":null},"6":{"skillId":11623,"type":2,"name":"Moonsign Benediction: Assemblage Hub","description":"When a party member triggers an Electro-Charged reaction, it will be converted into the Lunar-Charged reaction, with every 100 ATK that Ineffa has increasing Lunar-Charged's Base DMG by 0.7%, up to a maximum of 14%.\\n\\nAdditionally, when Ineffa is in the party, the party's <color=#FFD780FF>Moonsign</color> will increase by 1 level.","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_07","linkedConstellations":null},"8":{"skillId":11625,"type":2,"name":"Flavor Synthesis Unit","description":"When Ineffa uses food, there is a 30% chance of gaining a seasoning ingredient.\\n\\nAdditionally, in Nod-Krai, it seems you'll be able to change Birgitta's appearance through certain means...","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_08","linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":1161,"name":"Rectifying Processor","description":"When Ineffa activates her Optical Flow Shield Barrier, all nearby party members will gain the Carrier Flow Composite effect for 20s: Increases Lunar-Charged DMG by 2.5% for every 100 ATK that Ineffa has, up to a maximum of 50%.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_01"},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":1162,"name":"Support Cleaning Module","description":"After the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11165}Supreme Instruction: Cyclonic Exterminator{/LINK}</color> hits opponents, it will inflict the Punishment Edict status on one of those hit opponents: After a brief delay, or when this opponent is defeated, nearby opponents will take <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color> equal to 300% of Ineffa's ATK. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG.\\nAdditionally, when the Elemental Burst <color=#FFD780FF>Supreme Instruction: Cyclonic Exterminator</color> is unleashed, nearby party members will gain Optical Flow Shield Barriers.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_02","advancedProps":[{"name":"Extra Lunar-Charged","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"100","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":1163,"name":"Enhanced Emotion Emulator","description":"Increases the Level of <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11162}Cleaning Mode: Carrier Frequency{/LINK}</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Ineffa_01"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":1164,"name":"The Edictless Path","description":"When your own party members trigger Lunar-Charged reactions, recover 5 Elemental Energy. This effect can occur once every 4s.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_03"},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":1165,"name":"Mirror's Dream Transcension","description":"Increases the Level of <color=#FFD780FF>{LINK#S11165}Supreme Instruction: Cyclonic Exterminator{/LINK}</color> by 3.\\nMaximum upgrade level is 15.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Ineffa_02"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":1166,"name":"A Dawning Morn for You","description":"When Ineffa is affected by the Carrier Flow Composite effect, she will deal <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color> equal to 135% of her ATK to opponents in the current active character's vicinity after nearby thunderclouds release bursts of lightning at opponents. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG. The aforementioned effect can trigger once every 3.5s.","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Ineffa_04","advancedProps":[{"name":"Extra Lunar-Charged","elementalGaugeTheory":"0U","internalCooldown":null,"interruptionResistance":"50","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false}]}},"dictionary":{"talent":["N11160001"],"constellation":[],"effectsInfo":{"N11160001":{"id":11160001,"name":"Birgitta","description":"Ineffa's assistant and companion in battle, she can be summoned to the battlefield via Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst.\\nIf there are opponents nearby, Birgitta will quickly move close to an opponent and unleash Discharge attacks every 2s, dealing <color=#FFACFFFF>AoE Electro DMG</color>.\\nOnly one Birgitta that has been summoned by Ineffa herself can exist at any one time.\\n\\nAdditionally, in Nod-Krai, it seems you'll be able to change Birgitta's appearance through certain means...","params":null,"props":["","","","",""]}}}}}